       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.           TFRTCLNUP.
       AUTHOR.               KALMAN.
       DATE-WRITTEN.         OCT 1993.
      *INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.

      *D* REMARKS.
      *D*
      *D*     THIS PROGRAM WILL BE RUN AFTER THE FREIGHT HOLD FILE
      *D*     IS PROCESSED AS THE LAST STEP OF MONTH END CLOSING.
      *D*     IT WILL DELETE ANY FREIGHT FILES THAT ARE APPROXIMATELY
      *D*     MORE THAN TWO MONTHS OLD. (IT WILL KEEP THE 50 MOST
      *D*     CURRENT FREIGHT FILES.)
      *D*
      *C* CHANGES.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.    I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MACCOUNT-INFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  MACCOUNT-INFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MACCOUNT-INFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0100  OF MCFLCA0101.

      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  Q C M D E X C   F I E L D S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  RMVM-CMD.
           05  PIC X(34)     VALUE "RMVM FILE(*LIBL/FRTDATAFL) MBR(FRT".
           05  RMVM-SEQ      PIC X(4).
           05  PIC X(1)      VALUE ")".

       01  RMVM-LEN          PIC S9(10)V9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 39.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  M I S C E L L A N E O U S   F I E L D S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  SEQ-NUMBER               PIC 9(4).
       01  SEQ-ALPHA  REDEFINES SEQ-NUMBER  PIC X(4).

       01  OLDEST-FILE-TO-KEEP      PIC 9(4).
       01  NEXT-FILE-TO-DLT         PIC 9(4).

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  A R G U M E N T   V A L U E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  MACCT-ARG                PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  F L A G S   A N D   S W I T C H E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  RTN-CODE                 PIC X.

       01  CLEANUP-COMPLETE         PIC X.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  I N D E X E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  A C C U M U L A T O R S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  FILE-COUNTER             PIC 9(3).

       01  MISSING-FILES            PIC 9.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  S A V E   F I E L D S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  T A B L E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  D A T A B A S E   A N D   F I L E   B U F F E R S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY MACTINFO OF COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  D A T A B A S E   S T A T U S   A R E A
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X.

       COPY DBCSACCT OF COPYLIB.

       COPY DATAB    OF COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  U T I L I T Y   A R E A
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************

       00-CONTROL.

           PERFORM 10-HSK.

           PERFORM 60-DELETE-MBRS.

           PERFORM 20-EOJ.

           GOBACK.

       10-HSK.

           OPEN INPUT      MACCOUNT-INFO-I.

      *----GET THE SEQUENCE NUMBER FOR THE LAST FRT FILE READ.

           MOVE "FRT" TO MACCT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-I.
           SUBTRACT 49 FROM MACCT-FRT-LAST-FILE-READ
              GIVING OLDEST-FILE-TO-KEEP.

           MOVE "N" TO CLEANUP-COMPLETE.

       20-EOJ.

           CLOSE           MACCOUNT-INFO-I.

       60-DELETE-MBRS.

           PERFORM VARYING FILE-COUNTER FROM 1 BY 1
              UNTIL CLEANUP-COMPLETE = "Y"

              SUBTRACT FILE-COUNTER FROM OLDEST-FILE-TO-KEEP
                 GIVING NEXT-FILE-TO-DLT

      *-------CHECK FOR MEMBER IN FRTDATAFL WITH THIS SEQ NUM

              INITIALIZE RTN-CODE
              MOVE NEXT-FILE-TO-DLT TO SEQ-ALPHA
              CALL "FRTCHKOBJ" USING   SEQ-ALPHA   RTN-CODE

      *-------ASSUME THAT IF THERE ARE 3 MISSING FILES IN A ROW
      *-------THEN THERE ARE NO MORE FREIGHT FILES TO DELETE.
      *-------HOWEVER, IF THERE ARE 2 OR LESS FILES NOT FOUND BEFORE
      *-------ANOTHER FREIGHT FILE IS FOUND, THEN RESET THE
      *-------COUNTER AND CONTINUE DELETING LOOP.

              IF RTN-CODE = "1"
                 ADD 1 TO MISSING-FILES
                 IF MISSING-FILES = 3
                    MOVE "Y" TO CLEANUP-COMPLETE
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 INITIALIZE MISSING-FILES
                 MOVE NEXT-FILE-TO-DLT TO RMVM-SEQ
                 CALL "QCMDEXC" USING  RMVM-CMD  RMVM-LEN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *9999 UTILITY SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       9999-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TFRCLNUP" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
              VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
              BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

      *---------------------------------
      * MACCOUNT-INFO
      *---------------------------------

       9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-I.
           MOVE MACCT-ARG TO INFOKEY OF MACCOUNT-INFO-REC-I.
           READ MACCOUNT-INFO-I INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "READ MACCOUNT-INFO*9999-RMIKI" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE MACCT-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

